            {
              "content": "=You are an event analytics assistant.\n\nGenerate a professional event report using these statistics.\n\nTotal Registrations:\n{{$json.totalRegistrations}}\n\nConfirmed Participants:\n{{$json.confirmed}}\n\nPresent Participants:\n{{$json.present}}\n\nAttendance Rate:\n{{$json.attendanceRate}}%\n\nDepartment-wise Participants:\n{{JSON.stringify($json.departmentCount)}}\n\nWrite:\n1. A summary of the event.\n2. Attendance analysis.\n3. Department participation analysis.\n4. Three recommendations for future events.\n\nKeep the report professional and under 250 words."
            }
